# Tracked docs — commit and push together

The four tracked docs are `docs/NOW.md`, `docs/ME.md`, `docs/ATO_PLAN_v2.md`, and `docs/BUSINESS.md`.

When you update **any** of them:

1. Check the other three for overlapping facts (bundle ID, Stage 8 status, Apple/EAS, account type, what's next). Sync them in the **same** change — do not update only NOW.md.
2. Commit those doc updates together (with related code if this is the same unit of work).
3. **`git push` to origin immediately.** Never leave a commit that touches these docs sitting local-only.

This standing instruction overrides the default "don't push unless asked" rule for these four files only.
